  "solution": "Let us analyze the options:\n\ni) ÷ and +, 172 and 2\n\n→ 172 - 4 + 5 × 4 = 2 × 5 ÷ 13\n\n→ 2 - 4 ÷ 5 × 4 = 172 × 5 + 13\n\nApplying BODMAS rule;\n\n→ 2 - 0.8 × 4 = 172 × 5 + 13\n\n→ 2 – 3.2 = 860 + 13\n\n→- 1.2 ≠ 873\n\n**ii) ÷ and - , 13 and 2**\n\n**→ 172 - 4 + 5 × 4 = 2 × 5 ÷ 13**\n\n**→ 172 ÷ 4 + 5 × 4 = 13 × 5 - 2**\n\n**Applying BODMAS rule;**\n\n**→ 43 + 5 × 4 = 13 × 5 - 2**\n\n**→ 43 + 5 × 4 = 13 × 5 – 2**\n\n**→ 43 + 20 = 65 – 2**\n\n**→ 63 = 63**\n\niii) + and ÷, 172 and 13\n\n→ 13 - 4 ÷ 5 × 4 = 2 × 5 + 172\n\n→ 13 - 0.8 × 4 = 2 × 5 + 172\n\n→ 13 – 3.2 = 10 + 172\n\n→ 9.8 = 182\n\n→ 9.8 ≠ 182\n\niv) ÷ and - , 13 and 172\n\n→ 13 ÷ 4 + 5 × 4 = 2 × 5 - 172\n\n→ 3.25 + 5 × 4 = 2 × 5 – 172\n\n→ 3.25 + 20 = 10 - 172\n\n→ 23.25 ≠ - 162\n\nHence, ‘÷ and - , 13 and 2’ need to be interchanged so as to balance the given equation.",
